WEBVTT

00:00.330 --> 00:02.640
Wait, Makabe! What are you doing?!

00:02.640 --> 00:04.690
Then there's you!

00:04.690 --> 00:07.400
Even if this is all just a 
giant misunderstanding,

00:07.400 --> 00:11.530
I can't let your current ugly 
personality off the hook!

00:12.090 --> 00:12.880
Ug—

00:13.840 --> 00:15.280
So really...

00:16.150 --> 00:18.240
If you're gonna go out with someone like him...

00:22.550 --> 00:23.770
Go out with the real...

00:24.810 --> 00:26.170
Go out with me instead!

02:05.720 --> 02:11.900
<b>#5 "So We Became a Couple"</b>

02:05.930 --> 02:08.000
Don't think I'm gonna take this lying down,

02:08.000 --> 02:10.400
you shallow piece of shit who's 
only got his face going for him.

02:11.400 --> 02:13.260
Who are you calling shallow?!

02:13.260 --> 02:15.640
You've been popular enough!

02:15.640 --> 02:18.490
You're just pissed because 
Aki-chan won't look your way!

02:18.490 --> 02:20.240
That's not what this is about!

02:22.910 --> 02:26.870
I won't let some popular guy use 
Aki-chan for his stupid pride!

02:27.830 --> 02:30.830
<i>A popular guy's pride?</i>

02:31.320 --> 02:34.540
<i>If I had anything like that, 
none of this would have...</i>

02:35.490 --> 02:37.760
I've never been popular.

02:38.120 --> 02:40.960
What? Give me a break with your fake humility!

02:40.960 --> 02:42.100
It's the truth.

02:42.510 --> 02:46.140
My earliest memories were of me 
being bullied for being the fat kid.

02:47.270 --> 02:49.830
My classmates always mocked me.

02:50.600 --> 02:51.750
And then...

02:57.320 --> 03:02.360
I ran into that arrogant little 
girl's yard, and she saved me.

03:04.400 --> 03:06.700
Masa...mune?

03:10.230 --> 03:11.190
Huh?

03:11.920 --> 03:14.250
Makabe Masa...

03:15.080 --> 03:16.420
Masamune?

03:17.830 --> 03:19.130
That's right.

03:20.280 --> 03:24.350
The fat kid who ran away from your 
place eight years ago wasn't Gasou.

03:24.930 --> 03:25.820
It was me.

03:30.640 --> 03:31.380
Qui...

03:31.770 --> 03:34.330
Quit lying! That's a total fabrication!

03:35.040 --> 03:38.650
Aki-chan! Are you actually 
taking this guy seriously?!

03:39.190 --> 03:41.790
Don't you remember how many 
times he made you cry?

03:41.790 --> 03:43.910
Who are you gonna believe? Me or him?!

03:43.910 --> 03:45.280
Kanetsugu...

03:45.280 --> 03:48.520
That's right! That's the right choice! 
Exactly, Aki-chan!

03:48.520 --> 03:52.250
No, that's not what I'm saying... Why do you...

03:52.700 --> 03:54.790
have cleavage?

03:56.800 --> 03:58.170
Cleavage?

04:03.830 --> 04:07.690
Er, it's just... I never mentioned it.

04:07.690 --> 04:10.060
I'm still the head of my household.

04:10.330 --> 04:14.040
Oh, I think the hospital is calling me.

04:14.520 --> 04:16.280
Excuse me now!

04:27.240 --> 04:30.120
You're... Masamune?

04:31.920 --> 04:33.900
I said I was, didn't I?

04:35.340 --> 04:38.060
<i>How are we supposed to act now?!</i>

04:40.310 --> 04:43.120
Seriously, I can't believe 
how oblivious you are.

04:43.120 --> 04:44.890
So you're into girls now?

04:44.890 --> 04:47.760
W-Well, you didn't realize it, either!

04:48.080 --> 04:50.620
I mean, the time we spent 
together is different.

04:50.620 --> 04:52.760
What's wrong with your eyes? 
Do you even have any?

04:52.760 --> 04:54.230
Oh, shut up!

04:54.230 --> 04:56.620
Yeah, so I'm oblivious and blind.

04:56.620 --> 04:58.690
I'm arrogant and have an ugly personality!

04:59.140 --> 05:01.820
<i>Well, she took that quite personally.</i>

05:01.820 --> 05:03.150
So in that regard...

05:03.150 --> 05:05.390
Why did you make that request earlier?

05:05.390 --> 05:09.660
Request? When did I ever 
request anything from you?

05:09.660 --> 05:12.540
You did! You asked me to go out with you!

05:15.750 --> 05:17.080
Go out with the real...

05:17.080 --> 05:18.460
Go out with me instead!

05:18.910 --> 05:21.180
<i>That's the "request" you're talking about?</i>

05:21.180 --> 05:22.920
<i>Did I really say that?</i>

05:22.920 --> 05:26.940
Er, that was just... me going 
with the flow... or something.

05:26.940 --> 05:28.020
All right.

05:28.650 --> 05:29.430
Huh?

05:29.890 --> 05:34.850
If you're that insistent, 
I don't mind accepting your request.

05:35.910 --> 05:38.040
Wait, does that mean...

05:39.240 --> 05:42.820
I'm saying that I'll go out with you.

05:47.410 --> 05:48.330
Huh?

05:58.310 --> 05:59.420
Kane-chama!

06:01.000 --> 06:01.960
Hey.

06:02.620 --> 06:05.320
Wh-What happened to your face?

06:05.320 --> 06:08.410
I was punched. Like, "wham!"

06:08.890 --> 06:10.780
What? But that's so mean!

06:11.260 --> 06:13.500
I know, right? He didn't hold back, either.

06:13.500 --> 06:15.320
He really is awful.

06:17.110 --> 06:18.540
Kane-chama?

06:19.750 --> 06:22.170
Are you crying, Kane-chama?

06:24.190 --> 06:28.550
I guess they all know now! 
Honestly, I feel great!

06:30.020 --> 06:31.120
Kane-chama?

06:31.120 --> 06:32.430
I wonder what I should do now.

06:32.430 --> 06:35.310
Maybe I'll have him take 
some responsibility, too.

06:35.310 --> 06:36.680
Responsibility?

06:37.560 --> 06:39.080
Please quiet down!

06:58.680 --> 07:00.480
Don't forget.

07:00.480 --> 07:04.980
You're the one who asked me out, 
meaning I have the upper hand here.

07:07.720 --> 07:08.650
Are you listening to me?

07:08.650 --> 07:10.600
O-Of course I am!

07:17.990 --> 07:19.410
Onii-chan!

07:20.240 --> 07:23.880
I keep telling you dinner's ready! 
Your miso soup is gonna get cold.

07:28.840 --> 07:30.340
Onii-chan!

07:34.910 --> 07:36.620
Oof. Sad.

07:40.260 --> 07:41.740
Onii-chan?

07:44.230 --> 07:49.910
M-Mom! I think Onii-chan just died!

07:53.170 --> 07:55.910
M-Makabe-senpai...

07:57.650 --> 07:59.120
I love you.

07:59.570 --> 08:02.580
<i>How many does that make this month?</i>

08:03.000 --> 08:07.250
<i>Do they all just want to 
find someone by Christmas?</i>

08:07.700 --> 08:10.600
<i>Aren't you cold with your 
legs exposed like that?</i>

08:10.600 --> 08:13.260
<i>I just want to get back to class...</i>

08:13.700 --> 08:17.370
I was wondering i-if you'd go out with...

08:17.370 --> 08:18.970
I'm sorry, I can't.

08:19.310 --> 08:20.730
I see...

08:20.730 --> 08:24.240
<i>I'm trying to act as natural as 
possible and seem apologetic</i>

08:24.240 --> 08:26.440
<i>so they won't feel so bad...</i>

08:26.440 --> 08:28.730
I promise it's not you.

08:28.730 --> 08:31.640
I guess the rumors are true, then.

08:31.640 --> 08:32.400
Huh?

08:32.400 --> 08:37.370
So Adagaki-senpai, who hates men, 
finally fell for Makabe-senpai...

08:39.180 --> 08:41.160
I'm not sure if "fell for" is the right term...

08:41.160 --> 08:43.630
But it's true that we're going out.

08:43.630 --> 08:48.040
I see. I guess you're happy now.

08:48.040 --> 08:49.740
Y-Yes...

08:49.740 --> 08:51.050
But I...

08:51.050 --> 08:52.920
I don't care if I'm your number two!

08:52.920 --> 08:54.170
What?!

08:54.170 --> 08:58.030
Please let me have some of your time, too!

08:58.030 --> 09:00.410
Uh, wait... I don't know about that!

09:00.880 --> 09:02.140
Oh, I know. Here!

09:02.140 --> 09:04.350
Just think of this as me!

09:02.140 --> 09:04.350
<b></b>Vitamin B12

09:02.140 --> 09:04.350
<b></b>Vitamin C

09:02.180 --> 09:04.350
<b></b>Amino Acids

09:02.220 --> 09:04.350
<b></b>1% Juice

09:06.090 --> 09:06.940
Bye!

09:06.940 --> 09:08.600
Senpai!

09:12.020 --> 09:14.420
Senpai's leftovers...

09:15.440 --> 09:17.460
Not bad!

09:21.240 --> 09:26.320
Man... The ones who keep 
approaching me lately are intense.

09:26.320 --> 09:30.870
Well, you two just formed a superstar couple. 
That doesn't happen often.

09:31.460 --> 09:36.430
Most of the young ladies and gentlemen 
are crying themselves to sleep at night.

09:36.430 --> 09:38.930
If they aren't, they're probably 
coming after you now.

09:40.070 --> 09:41.780
That must be rough.

09:43.400 --> 09:46.910
Don't have too much fun with all this, 
Fujinomiya-san. It doesn't conce—

09:46.910 --> 09:49.590
It doesn't concern me?

09:55.820 --> 10:00.010
I might be one of the ones 
crying herself to sleep each night.

10:00.010 --> 10:01.900
I-I'm sorry! Forgive me!

10:01.900 --> 10:05.790
I know there's been a lot going on, 
so I had to put this off, but I...

10:10.360 --> 10:13.960
No, it's not like I wanted to hear an answer.

10:14.720 --> 10:16.330
What do you mean?

10:16.330 --> 10:18.120
Well, considering the circumstances...

10:18.120 --> 10:21.680
We don't know what's going 
to happen, so we can hold off.

10:22.310 --> 10:25.140
Yes, that's for the best.

10:27.220 --> 10:30.300
So you're just going to enjoy this mess.

10:30.300 --> 10:31.110
Oh, my.

10:51.160 --> 10:53.340
Considering the circumstances, huh?

10:55.910 --> 10:57.080
So, Pig's Foot...

10:59.010 --> 11:00.730
I need you to save Aki-sama.

11:05.900 --> 11:07.020
Go out with the real...

11:08.000 --> 11:09.430
Go out with me instead!

11:10.620 --> 11:14.190
I'm saying that I'll go out with you.

11:14.730 --> 11:20.010
<i>So I guess that means Fujinomiya-san 
sees through everything.</i>

11:20.690 --> 11:24.160
<i>Yeah, we may be going out, but...</i>

11:24.410 --> 11:28.760
<i>I mean... I was the one who asked her out.</i>

11:29.150 --> 11:31.460
<i>I can't go back on that now.</i>

11:31.960 --> 11:33.130
<b></b>You have a new message.

11:36.090 --> 11:41.050
<b>Cruel Princess</b>

11:36.090 --> 11:41.050
<b>Go buy me
some bread for lunch.</b>

11:36.440 --> 11:38.600
<i>Go buy me some bread for lunch.</i>

11:38.600 --> 11:40.540
Wow, she pisses me off.

11:50.980 --> 11:53.560
God, I don't want to go into that mess.

11:54.480 --> 11:58.440
<i>Hurry up. If you don't, I'll shrivel up 
and die like some zebra on the savanna.</i>

11:54.480 --> 11:58.440
<b>Cruel Princess</b>

11:54.480 --> 11:58.440
<b>Hurry up!
If you don't, I'll shrivel up and die
like some zebra on the savanna.</b>

11:58.440 --> 12:01.190
<i>Zebras don't eat croquette buns!</i>

12:02.990 --> 12:06.720
Rising Sun!

12:06.720 --> 12:11.290
Ma'am, can I get three 
explosive croquette buns and...

12:11.290 --> 12:12.830
You need to speak up!

12:13.150 --> 12:16.440
Why don't you yell like you did the other day?

12:16.440 --> 12:17.160
Huh?

12:17.880 --> 12:23.950
What?!

12:27.510 --> 12:30.110
If you cause that much of a ruckus,

12:30.110 --> 12:32.480
it'll draw more attention 
to me that I don't need.

12:32.480 --> 12:34.650
Well, I mean, obviously I'm surprised.

12:34.650 --> 12:39.130
I heard you pretty much ghosted everyone 
after that, so you just popping up was...

12:39.130 --> 12:41.760
The school took pity on me and let me work.

12:41.760 --> 12:43.770
Because I'm flat broke.

12:43.770 --> 12:45.490
Flat broke? What do you mean?

12:46.900 --> 12:50.450
This was all part of my plan. "Plan F."

12:50.450 --> 12:51.760
F?

12:51.760 --> 12:53.850
F as in fishing.

12:53.850 --> 12:55.830
What? Fishing?

12:56.980 --> 12:59.530
I was going to act like I was 
you from eight years ago

12:59.530 --> 13:03.380
and fish financial support 
from the Adagaki family.

13:03.790 --> 13:07.950
Financial support... Why would you do that?

13:07.950 --> 13:10.160
I've got a lot going on.

13:10.160 --> 13:14.350
Well, that plan gloriously 
fell apart, didn't it?

13:14.730 --> 13:16.860
With you punching me and all.

13:16.860 --> 13:19.860
Well, I didn't know you were a girl.

13:19.860 --> 13:24.010
So I managed to pay back all the expenses.

13:19.860 --> 13:25.320
For Sale

13:24.010 --> 13:25.660
I sold off our mansion.

13:25.320 --> 13:28.320
<b>For Sale</b>

13:25.660 --> 13:27.430
What?! You sold your home?!

13:28.720 --> 13:30.330
Are you gonna be okay?

13:35.020 --> 13:36.960
Honestly, I feel relieved.

13:36.960 --> 13:40.250
I was pushing myself way too hard 
to make my family look good.

13:40.880 --> 13:45.620
And I had to keep lying to 
people around me to do so.

13:47.080 --> 13:49.290
Now I just get to enjoy myself.

13:49.290 --> 13:51.940
I get to live in an apartment 
with nothing tying me down.

13:53.160 --> 13:57.140
I promised my little sister we'd go to a 
bathhouse once she's out of the hospital.

13:58.600 --> 13:59.820
Gasou...

14:00.290 --> 14:03.360
I don't have to force myself to 
act like a guy anymore, either.

14:07.300 --> 14:08.660
<i>I see...</i>

14:10.050 --> 14:13.980
<i>It's true that I was pissed when she used 
my name and tried to act like me...</i>

14:14.610 --> 14:18.060
<i>And I was wondering what 
happened after all that.</i>

14:20.690 --> 14:21.880
I'm glad.

14:22.960 --> 14:27.130
I guess that might be weird coming from me.

14:27.130 --> 14:29.260
Yeah, it's pretty weird.

14:29.260 --> 14:34.540
But to think that the bullied, chubby little 
Masamune-kun would change so much.

14:34.540 --> 14:38.100
Wh-What? Now you're gonna threaten me?

14:38.100 --> 14:41.770
No. Honestly, I sorta want you 
to take responsibility for this.

14:41.770 --> 14:42.560
Responsibility?

14:43.350 --> 14:44.670
Make me your wife.

14:45.390 --> 14:46.230
What?!

14:46.230 --> 14:50.030
I thought about it and realized 
that you're pretty rich yourself,

14:50.030 --> 14:51.680
and you get good grades,

14:51.680 --> 14:53.880
so you've also got a pretty promising future.

14:53.880 --> 14:57.150
See? I guess I don't have to give up just yet.

14:57.150 --> 14:58.840
Nope! Not happening! Do you hear yourself?!

14:58.840 --> 15:01.290
I'm already dating someone, anyway!

15:03.880 --> 15:05.720
Why are you taking this so seriously?

15:05.720 --> 15:07.630
Wait, what?! It was a joke?!

15:07.630 --> 15:10.730
You really just said, 
"I'm already dating someone!"

15:10.730 --> 15:12.140
You mean...

15:13.060 --> 15:14.850
Aki-chan, don't you?

15:16.360 --> 15:17.780
Oh, never mind!

15:22.840 --> 15:28.730
<i>Man, you really are strange, Masamune-kun.</i>

15:33.910 --> 15:36.440
Upsy-daisy...

15:37.280 --> 15:40.170
I wonder if this thing really works...

15:43.720 --> 15:45.340
What are you doing?

15:47.400 --> 15:48.860
Makabe!

15:49.800 --> 15:53.850
T-Took you long enough! 
Did you actually go to Africa or something?

15:53.850 --> 15:55.830
A-A lot happened, okay?

15:58.260 --> 15:59.240
What?

16:01.330 --> 16:02.420
A stove?

16:03.340 --> 16:07.790
Yoshino found it back there. 
I thought I might be able to use it.

16:07.790 --> 16:09.740
You just want it out here? Hup.

16:10.440 --> 16:11.880
Th-Thank—

16:11.880 --> 16:13.050
I'll set it in the center.

16:13.050 --> 16:13.940
Huh?!

16:15.240 --> 16:17.410
Uh, sure...

16:22.580 --> 16:26.330
The only problem with 
this shed is that it's cold.

16:26.330 --> 16:29.500
Are you planning to spend 
the long winter in here?

16:29.500 --> 16:33.000
Shut up and just give me the food you bought!

16:33.000 --> 16:35.010
Yeah, yeah, Zebra-sama.

16:37.970 --> 16:40.810
Man, is it that hard to just say thank you?

16:40.810 --> 16:42.430
Explosive
<b>Croquette Bun</b>

16:42.430 --> 16:46.640
O-Of course I can! I was just about to 
say it! It's the right thing to do!

16:46.640 --> 16:47.870
Uh-huh...

16:52.120 --> 16:55.130
Here. You can have this.

16:55.130 --> 16:57.370
Good job. Here's your treat.

16:57.370 --> 17:00.330
<b>Explosive</b>

16:57.370 --> 17:00.330
<b>Croquette Bun</b>

17:00.910 --> 17:03.020
Having fried food right now might be, uh...

17:03.440 --> 17:07.210
And you can have a rice ball, too. 
Do you want salmon or cod roe?

17:07.210 --> 17:09.290
I have my own thing, okay?!

17:09.290 --> 17:11.550
That's not enough! You need to eat more!

17:11.550 --> 17:13.920
The old Masamune was much rounder!

17:15.380 --> 17:17.530
We should get some 
donuts after school, too.

17:17.530 --> 17:19.850
Also, you need to try this new drink.

17:19.850 --> 17:21.050
Wait, wait, wait!

17:21.050 --> 17:23.130
<i>What is this plan of fattening me up again?</i>

17:23.130 --> 17:25.810
<i>I got skinny so I could get revenge on you!</i>

17:28.610 --> 17:30.580
<i>Though it was all a misunderstanding...</i>

17:33.540 --> 17:35.960
<i>Not like I can say any of that.</i>

17:36.360 --> 17:39.530
The new one is apparently 
white chocolate whipped cream.

17:39.900 --> 17:41.760
Let's go right after school, and...

17:41.760 --> 17:42.650
Um...

17:43.150 --> 17:45.000
Sorry, I'm gonna pass.

17:45.330 --> 17:46.200
Huh?

17:47.460 --> 17:48.270
Huh?

17:48.270 --> 17:51.260
Er, I mean...

17:51.260 --> 17:54.730
But how am I supposed to reward you, then?

17:54.730 --> 17:56.130
No, really!

17:56.930 --> 17:58.210
Just the sentiment...

17:59.340 --> 18:00.940
is more than enough.

18:11.960 --> 18:14.810
D-Don't touch me so casually!

18:15.120 --> 18:17.110
S-Sorry! I wasn't thinking!

18:20.280 --> 18:23.580
I got some kerosene from the janitor's office.

18:29.080 --> 18:30.250
Well, bye!

18:40.840 --> 18:46.570
Man, I panicked. 
But why the heck was I panicking?

18:48.610 --> 18:51.720
<i>The one who called me 
Pig's Foot wasn't Adagaki Aki.</i>

18:52.530 --> 18:54.790
<i>And Master feels bad about it.</i>

18:59.530 --> 19:03.040
<i>I don't have anyone to hate anymore...</i>

19:08.680 --> 19:09.510
Huh?

19:20.530 --> 19:22.220
U-Um...

19:22.220 --> 19:23.580
Master!

19:31.620 --> 19:36.220
<i>Master and I used to come here pretty often.</i>

19:37.670 --> 19:41.180
<i>We'd talk about the details of our plan...</i>

19:46.000 --> 19:49.190
Was that the tree she 
hung me upside-down from?

19:51.240 --> 19:53.580
No. It's the next one over.

19:56.090 --> 19:58.460
I'll do it again if you'd like.

19:59.280 --> 20:00.930
I'll pass, thanks.

20:00.930 --> 20:03.190
How did our conversation turn into this?

20:04.240 --> 20:05.560
You're right.

20:06.410 --> 20:09.020
We should get to the point.

20:09.020 --> 20:12.190
Y-Yeah, I was just wondering 
how you're doing lately.

20:12.190 --> 20:13.890
No problems?

20:13.890 --> 20:15.930
No. Nothing.

20:15.930 --> 20:17.270
That's good.

20:17.980 --> 20:23.950
It's because you didn't tell 
Aki-sama what I did.

20:29.780 --> 20:32.300
I mean, what would be the point?

20:32.300 --> 20:36.090
I almost let slip to her that I tried 
to get close to her for revenge.

20:37.620 --> 20:38.980
<i>Most importantly...</i>

20:40.220 --> 20:44.360
<i>I couldn't blame you, 
since you continued to feel bad.</i>

20:50.320 --> 20:53.600
Despite everything that happened, 
I'm going out with her.

20:53.600 --> 20:55.530
That part is on track.

20:56.340 --> 20:58.970
I see. So everything's okay, then.

20:58.970 --> 21:00.440
Well, actually...

21:00.440 --> 21:03.080
I'm sorry! It's not okay!

21:03.080 --> 21:05.660
Going out with someone is super hard!

21:08.620 --> 21:10.440
Honestly, Pig's Foot...

21:10.440 --> 21:13.950
Yes, you can call me a pig all you want!

21:13.950 --> 21:16.940
Considering she clearly 
wants me to become a pig!

21:16.940 --> 21:19.920
What am I supposed to do now, Master Koiwai?

21:19.920 --> 21:21.400
Please show me some mercy!

21:21.400 --> 21:24.230
I beg of you! Koiwai-sama!

21:29.160 --> 21:31.320
This is your last bonus.

21:31.320 --> 21:34.680
Aki-sama's birthday is the 24th of this month.

21:34.990 --> 21:36.770
Christmas Eve!

